            "type": "text",
            "text": "a strange trip, a surprising job interview, an unexpected neighbour",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "). O aluno reage com surpresa/interesse, usa ruídos de escuta e faz pelo menos "
